# The ICU 78 data items OpenBrowser keeps (scripts/build-icu.sh): the root and
# English (en, en_001, en_GB, en_US) locales, every break rule,
# normalisation and character properties. No text converters: WebKit decodes
# every web encoding itself (TextCodecCJK, TextCodecSingleByte and the UTF
# codecs), so ICU's 190 legacy tables were never used. No Thai or
# Chinese/Japanese word-break dictionaries for now (Dale, 6 Oct 2026): such
# text still breaks at spaces and punctuation. Other locales fall back to root.
# MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 Dalsin Limited.
